# The site deploy syncs this repo into the zqmlabs.com build via git archive
# (zqmlabs-site scripts/sync-player.sh). Without export-ignore, the player's
# _headers file (X-Frame-Options: DENY on /*) lands in the site tree at
# /games/hunt-for-wisps/play/_headers. Cloudflare Pages only parses the root
# _headers today, so it is inert — but it would break framing of the embedded
# game if that tree were ever served standalone or the file hoisted. The file
# stays in this repo for any direct player deployment; it just stays out of
# the site export.
_headers export-ignore
